<title>MACEDONIA: Macedonia devalues denar to 31 to mark from 27.1.</title>
<headline>Macedonia devalues denar to 31 to mark from 27.1.</headline>
<dateline>SKOPJE 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macedonia on Wednesday devalued the denar to 31 to the mark from 27.1 as part of a package of measures agreed with the IMF which include a freeze on state sector wages, the finance ministry said.</p>
</text>
